abstract: >
  The Aerostratospheric Defense GIR is an open-tier Geospatial Information
  Repository that automatically collects public hazard, Earth-observation index,
  and defense-adjacent open datasets, validates them, tracks provenance, and
  versions them in git for reproducible awareness support at the unclassified boundary.
